Stellar contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  - CLI:      https://github.com/stellar-scaffold/cli
  - Template: https://github.com/stellar-scaffold/ui
  - Docs:     https://stellarscaffold.org

The project structure, the Vite/React app, app-lib (network, wallet, friendbot
and event helpers), the contract-client generation workflow, the
environments.toml configuration and the OpenZeppelin example contracts come
from the Scaffold Stellar template. Files from the template were modified for
this project, mainly to:
  - target Stellar testnet in development instead of a local Docker network;
  - remove the guess-the-number example and the template's CI, e2e and
    contributor files;
  - add Trustless Work escrows (app/src/trustless), Cavos embedded wallets
    (app/src/cavos), a reputation contract (contracts/reputation), helper
    scripts (scripts/) and agent skills (AGENTS.md, .agents/skills);
  - fix the event subscription topic filter (app-lib/subscription.ts).

Third-party material included in this repository:
  - .agents/skills/trustless-work/references/official/: the official Trustless
    Work agent skill, https://github.com/Trustless-Work/trustlesswork-skill,
    Apache License 2.0 (see the LICENSE file in that folder).

Main third-party dependencies (installed from npm / crates.io, not vendored):
@trustless-work/escrow, @cavos/kit (MIT), @creit.tech/stellar-wallets-kit,
@stellar/stellar-sdk, soroban-sdk and OpenZeppelin stellar-contracts.
